{"availability":"available","full":"tjromack/payment-integrity-reviewer","name":"payment-integrity-reviewer","description":"A reviewer queue for payment-integrity claims on synthetic data. Three deterministic rules flag duplicate billing, unbundling and out-of-network adjudication; every flag shows the fields that fired it and a grounded explanation; a human approves, dismisses or escalates. Live demo runs cached, no API key.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-10T01:45:54Z","updated":"2026-10-06T23:43:20Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://payment-integrity-reviewer.onrender.com/","topics":["anthropic","claude","docker","fastapi","healthcare","htmx","llm","python","sqlite"],"demo":"https://payment-integrity-reviewer.onrender.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:32:24.821Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:32:24.821Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:32:24.821Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:22.963Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:24.821Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["© 2026 Trevor J. Romack — source-available for review, not open-source (LICENSE). No reuse or commercial use without permission. · tjromack@gmail.com","A claims-review workflow that detects likely payment-integrity issues on synthetic claims with transparent rules, explains each flag in plain English with an LLM, and routes them through a human approval queue — with a running tally of estimated dollars identified.","It brings together automation, decision support, a human-in-the-loop experience, cost-savings tracking, and responsible AI in a payment-integrity workflow. The defining design choice — keeping detection transparent and auditable while using AI only for explanation — is the \"where AI should and should not be used\" judgment applied to a regulated, high-stakes workflow."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"h